 "level_notes": {"0": "Squeak and Pharo descend from the Apple Smalltalk-80 image; their shared VM is OpenSmalltalk (Cog/Spur), generated from Smalltalk (VMMaker) to C. Pharo source is kept as Tonel .st files.", "1": "The Blue Book (Goldberg & Robson 1983) defines Smalltalk-80 including a formal VM specification (Part Four); ANSI INCITS 319-1998 standardises the language core and protocols (paywalled; only unofficial drafts circulate). Blue Book deep links are PDF page links into the Ducasse free-books scan.", "2": "Squeak and Pharo books (Pharo by Example etc.) are free."},
